'''Cloddograns''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] of which [[Bargwill Tomder]] was a member.<ref name="Hear Nothing, See Nothing, Say Nothing" /> At some point, two Cloddograns menaced [[Mahjo Reeloo]] in [[Galagolos spaceport]] on the [[planet]] [[Galagolos V]] until [[Hondo Ohnaka]] saved her.<ref name="Pirate's Price">''[[Pirate's Price]]''</ref>

